        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                "word": "cherté",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "064054ea-7d6e-4844-abbd-f71d4fcfa63d",
                        "entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chertés"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                        "entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prix qui excède de beaucoup le prix ordinaire des choses."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8cb804fd-3373-4194-bdd4-5473b9793644",
                                "sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                                "text": "Les veuves pensionnées forment ici toute l’aristocratie ; elles se tiennent bien, balaient souvent leur chambre, bavardent avec leurs amies de la cherté de la viande et du chou : elles […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f5fe553-4d3a-4717-9a79-42d023e8234b",
                                "sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                                "text": "Décrire la société gardoise à la sortie de la crise quarante-huitarde, entre 1851 et 1853, c'est tenter de saisir des milieux sociaux dans une phase mouvante, phase de reprise économique d'abord lente, puis plus assurée, de hausse des prix ou, comme on dit alors, de «cherté de vie», période également où se dessine un bilan des perturbations sociales apportées ici par la Révolution de 1848, où le mouvement social tâtonne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec3eca0c-278f-4eb4-a122-0bc40609486a",
                                "sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                                "text": "La cherté des forfaits téléphoniques pour les ultramarins, qui ont souvent de la famille ou des amis dans les Dom ou en métropole, avait été l’un des sujets de mécontentement mis en exergue lors de la grave crise sociale de 2009."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0bc2ce2-fdb7-4497-859c-5645aace1a12",
                        "source_entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                        "source_sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                        "target_lang_word": "Teuerung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Teuerung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e258c67-c88c-327f-91f9-7a682337a1f3",
                                        "entry_id": "31ec38a8-5f62-3437-9c46-5aa2f640c44d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ansteigen der Preise"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e2891cc-462b-4176-9e36-fe3c79df77c8",
                                                "sense_id": "6e258c67-c88c-327f-91f9-7a682337a1f3",
                                                "text": "Dieses Jahr haben wir bisher nur eine geringe Teuerung."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41cd4884-623c-4a34-992b-f399415dc1db",
                                                "sense_id": "6e258c67-c88c-327f-91f9-7a682337a1f3",
                                                "text": "„Das Statistische Bundesamt erklärt die Teuerung beim Brot mit höheren Kosten für Energie und Rohstoffe, sowie für Personal.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ba0ae12-f90c-4e38-855f-f13d51e4d100",
                                                "sense_id": "6e258c67-c88c-327f-91f9-7a682337a1f3",
                                                "text": "„Und die hohlen Köpfe waren stets bereit, die Gettos zu stürmen und Juden totzuschlagen, wenn eine Teuerung den Beutel leerte und der Hunger den Magen knurren ließ.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9a6d766-c00a-3322-872d-1184c7d18cd8",
                                        "entry_id": "31ec38a8-5f62-3437-9c46-5aa2f640c44d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3578f791-3a45-4ee7-9dca-d17e89148c28",
                                                "sense_id": "c9a6d766-c00a-3322-872d-1184c7d18cd8",
                                                "text": "Die Teuerung als Hungersnot wird bereits in der Bibel genannt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54099bbd-05dd-41f1-9e03-a9e4d8b86a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "c9a6d766-c00a-3322-872d-1184c7d18cd8",
                                                "text": "„Bis zum November 1808 hatte ein französisches Husarenregiment in Brandenburg und Umgegend gehaust und die Futtervorräte so gänzlich aufgezehrt, daß eine arge Teuerung entstanden war.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a181ec5-5fa8-4706-b90d-3205c93e0bf0",
                        "source_entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                        "source_sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                        "target_lang_word": "hoher Preis",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99cdb13a-7e17-4c2b-b98b-8bb5213ca4d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                        "source_sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
                        "target_lang_word": "expensiveness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "expensiveness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "035cfcb2-8d44-3ef2-8a14-a3081606e116",
                                        "entry_id": "2d600f1e-4e7c-35d9-ad62-0b76d3c685ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being expensive; the entailing of great expense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "515c0b04-7886-45e7-809c-1ee3a203ebb4",
                                                "sense_id": "035cfcb2-8d44-3ef2-8a14-a3081606e116",
                                                "text": "1743, John Wesley, An Earnest Appeal to Men of Reason and Religion, London: G. Whitfield, 1796, A Farther Appeal to Men of Reason and Religion, Part II, III.1, p. 212, https://books.google.ca/books?id=A6FgAAAAcAAJ&printsec=frontcover#v=onepage&q&f=false\nSurely you cannot be ignorant, that the sinfulness of fine apparel lies chiefly in the expensiveness. In that it is robbing God and the Poor; it is defrauding the fatherless and the widow; it is wasting the food of the hungry, and with-holding his raiment from the naked, to consume it on our own lusts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "740eab6f-2876-4631-b374-6119f31c614d",
                                                "sense_id": "035cfcb2-8d44-3ef2-8a14-a3081606e116",
                                                "text": "1922, Emily Post, Etiquette in Society, in Business, in Politics, and at Home, Chapter 14: Formal Dinners, http://www.gutenberg.org/files/14314/14314-h/14314-h.htm\nEnchanting dining-rooms and tables have been achieved with an outlay amounting to comparatively nothing. ¶ There is a dining-room in a certain small New York house that is quite as inviting as it is lacking in expensiveness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bbcb043-4a00-43b0-8692-13fc94d98167",
                                                "sense_id": "035cfcb2-8d44-3ef2-8a14-a3081606e116",
                                                "text": "Apart from the expensiveness of everything, there were recurrent shortages of this and that, which, of course, always hit the poor rather than the rich."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a6d135e-f5d2-4d22-b3b7-db4df214833c",
                        "source_entry_id": "b860a046-73dc-3693-aa38-265f45f8e921",
                        "source_sense_id": "586e6cac-0ffe-3fe2-88fd-c81be27d33c1",
